  '2026-03-01',
  'Birch plywood base with a 4mm or 6mm Ash hardwood top layer. European Ash grown in responsibly managed European forests. Thickness 13/16/21mm, standard widths 140-200mm, wide plank widths 220-300mm (300mm available up to 5m length). Bevels (V-grooves) 2 or 4 side, square edges 2 or 4 side. Finished with high quality eco-friendly oil or hardwax oil, protected from yellowing. Suitable for underfloor heating. Factory prefinished to any colour from the Hoff Parquet catalogue.',
  'European Ash, grown in responsibly managed European forests',
  'High quality eco-friendly oil or hardwax oil, protected from yellowing',
  'Rustic: picturesque pattern, unrestricted colour variation, unrestricted sound knots, repaired knots up to 70mm, permitted sapwood, cracks up to 5mm filled. | Classic (Natural): vigorous colour palette, sound or repaired knots up to 40mm, permitted heartwood. | Select: more uniform colour, small areas of character, knots max 8mm diameter, slight stress cracks filled to match. | Premium: most uniform and perfect grade, natural colour variation, no knots, no sapwood.',
