values (
  'seed-riga-ash',
  'Riga Parket Ash Flooring',
  'Engineered Wood Flooring',
  'Ash',
  'm²',
  '2026-09-01',
  'Riga Parket engineered Ash flooring. Covers 2-layer 16/4mm (4mm ash wear layer on birch plywood core) and 3-layer 17/4mm (4mm ash wear layer on spruce core) constructions. Widths 150-240mm. Grades: Prime, Calm.',
  'Latvia (Riga Parket)',
  'Unfinished / pre-finish options available as surface services',
  'Prime: selected grade, without knots. Calm: selected grade, live/replaced knots <14%, neutral brown or black filler.',
