  'Latvia (Riga Parket)',
  'Unfinished / pre-finish options available as surface services',
  'Prime: selected grade, pin knots <4% of surface, without sapwood. Calm: selected grade, live/replaced knots <14%, without sapwood, neutral brown filler. Lively: sorted traditional grade, knots <23%, dead knots <14%, little cracks allowed, without sapwood, neutral brown filler. Character: traditional grade, knots <29%, dead knots <14%, cracks allowed, without sapwood, neutral brown filler.',
  'Supplier: SIA Riga Parket, Latvia. Source price list dated 1 September 2026, EUR excl. VAT, ex works Latvia. Converted to GBP at EUR/GBP 0.8601 (Bloomberg, 3 September 2026) then marked up 30% for UK client sell price, excl. VAT and delivery. Re-check the live rate before quoting large orders, as FX moves daily. Surcharges not included in variation prices: 21/5mm top layer +€3.00/m², oak bottom layer (3-layer boards) +€9.00/m², pre-finishing from €2.50-€15.00/m² depending on finish, surface services (extra brushed, hard brushed, fillers, saw marks, uneven bevels, hand-scraping, HeartWood butterflies) €2.00-€18.00/m² depending on treatment — apply these as separate line items or add to the unit price when quoting. A further 20% uplift was applied on top of the base 30% markup for these specific product lines.',
